  "only_variant_groups": false,
  "matn_start": 117,
  "notes": [
   "«عن الزهري، عن سعيد بن المسيب، وعن الأعرج، عن أبي هريرة»: the text writes «عن أبي هريرة» once, after the second name, so Sa'id and al-Araj are read as alternatives under Zuhri that both reach Abu Hurayra. The punctuation does not settle whether al-Araj stands under Zuhri or under Sa'id.",
   "«نحو حديث مالك» names another transmitter (Malik) for the same saying: a variant remark, not a route."
  ],
